{
  "id": "ACT.17",
  "number": "17",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Ŋitic. 17",
  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kisicanae Paulo ka ŋikeerukitos keŋ alo Tesalonika",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toloto ikes, kitoro lotaunio ŋulu ka Ampipoli ka Apolonia tari Tesalonika neni ayai esinagoga ŋolo a Ŋiyudayan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikwaŋina araakar epite a Paulo, abu tolosene losinagoga. Kiyana iŋes ka ŋituŋa a nen ŋirwa ŋuluuni ŋulu arae ŋulu a Sabato, tolimonokini ikes ŋakiro ŋuna igiritae Nakigireta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisileerek ka kitoodik ikes atemar etemokino Kristo toryamu ŋican ka toyaru alokatwak. Tolimu Paulo tema, “Yesu lo, ŋolo eserae ayoŋ neni kus, iŋes erae Kristo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tonupa ŋice alokidiŋ kec, toriwo neni a Paulo ka Silas. Tonupa daŋ Ŋigirik ŋulu alalak ŋulu ainakina neni ka Akuj, kaapei ka ŋaberu ŋuna alalak ŋuna apolok alotaun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai min arakao neni a Ŋiyudayan, kiriraut ŋikerimitok emaket ŋice, toyeut aruruma. Kisiguryakis ikes etaun daadaŋ, tolomasi ka agogoŋu lore a Yason, iwarito Paulo ka Silas ayaun ikes kiŋa lotuŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ani eryamunete ikes emamukasi, kiriut Yason kaapei ka ŋikanupak ŋice lokapolok ŋulu ke etaun, tocelas ebasi, “Etolomut ŋikilyok lu ŋakiro ŋuna aronok nakwap daadaŋ! Tokona apotu ikes lotaun yok ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka ejau Yason ikes kai keŋ. Eŋerito ikes daadaŋ ŋikisila ŋulu ke ekepukan a Roma, aŋuna ebaakatar ebe eyai erwosit ece ŋolo enyaritae Yesu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirarete ŋituŋa ka ŋikapolok ŋulu ke etaun ŋakiro ŋun, kiidakinos nooi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitelemut ŋikapolok Yason ka ŋuluce daŋ ŋisiliŋa ŋulu acamakinere ikes akiboi alokiŋa ejera. Tolacakis nai ikes toloto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tonupa ŋituŋa ŋulu alalak alo Berea",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋinapei ani ewari akwap, tolimokis ŋikanupak Paulo ka Silas atemar toloto Berea. Ani edolete ikes inaa, toloto losinagoga a Ŋiyudayan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apupete ŋituŋa a nen ŋakiro akilo ŋulu alo Tesalonika, anerae apotu kijaut ŋakiro ŋuna ka Akuj ecamito nooi, tosyomete a ŋinakoloŋit ŋakiro ŋuna igiritae Nakigireta, ecamito aripun erae kerae kire ŋakiro ŋuna erworo Paulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, tonupa ikes ŋulu alalak; tonupa daŋ Ŋigirik ŋulu alalak, ŋaberu ŋuna ajakaanak, kaapei ka ŋikilyok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ani iirarete Ŋiyudayan ŋulu alo Tesalonika atemar iserae Paulo ŋakiro ŋuna ka Akuj tari alo Berea, potu ikes neni daŋ, togeut akitutuk ŋituŋa, kisiguryakis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitenakis ŋikanupak Paulo atipei, tolot ananam; nai kidoŋo Silas ka Timoteo Berea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋikilyok ŋulu etenarete Paulo kitodolo iŋes Asen. Toboŋosi nai ikes Berea, kedau Paulo akicik ikes atemar okoryamut iŋes Silas ka Timoteo atipei alotooma apaki ŋina euruwuana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Alo Asen",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eriŋa Paulo idarit Silas ka Timoteo alo Asen, toronik iŋes nooi epite ŋolo alalaata ŋakujo alotaun a ŋol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, kirworo iŋes alosinagoga ka Ŋiyudayan kaapei ka ŋuluce ŋulu ainakina neni ka Akuj; kimocoete jwi jwi alomaket ka ŋulu arae ŋikalotok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimocoto daŋ iŋes ka ŋikaosok ŋulu anyaritae Ŋipikuriyae ka Ŋisitoikae. Temasi ŋice, “Inyoni ecamit ekile ŋolo irworo car lo alimun?” Temasi ŋice, “Esibit elimonokini iŋes ŋakiro ŋuna a ŋakujo a ŋuna egelaaka.” Alimunete ikes ŋun, anerae alimonokini Paulo ŋakiro ŋuna a Yesu ka ŋuna ka ayarun alokatwak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, tonyaraiyasi ikes iŋes yaasi loikiiko ŋolo ke etaun, ŋolo anyaritae Areopago, tolimokis iŋes temasi, “Ikicamit isua akiirar akitatam ŋina kitete na, ŋina itatami iyoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anerae epupyo isua ŋakiro ŋace ŋuna egelaaka; aŋun, ikicamit isua ayenun apolou kec.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Aminasi ŋituŋa ŋulu ka Asen ka ŋulu gelae ŋulu aya nen aayenen ŋapakio daadaŋ irworosi ŋakiro ŋuna alunyarosi ka akiiranar ŋuna kitet.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Towo Paulo alokiŋaren eikiiko ŋolo ka Areopago, kirworik tema, “Ŋituŋa ŋulu ka Asen, ayenu ayoŋ atemar iraakasi iyes ŋituŋa ŋulu iyaito ibore daadaŋ alowae a ŋolo ke edin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋina erimoritor ayoŋ etaun kus ka eŋolianak neni ilipyananaata iyes, abu oanyua neni imurotor iyes neni egiritae neni ebala, ‘Neni ka akuj a ŋina nyeyenio.’ Akuj ŋin nai, ŋina ilipete iyes neni keŋ nyiyenete, iŋes tokona eserae ayoŋ ŋakiro keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuj na ŋina asubuni akwap ka ibore daadaŋ ŋini eyai tooma keŋ, ŋina erae Ekapolon ŋolo anakuj ka akwap; nyiboi iŋes anakais a ŋuna edukito ŋituŋa akilipya ŋakujo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo daŋ nyiitanit iŋes akiŋarakinet a ŋituŋa esibit icana iŋes idiobore, torae bo iŋes einanakini akiyar ka ekieŋanu ta ŋiboro daadaŋ neni kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Akuj tosub ŋibukui a ŋituŋa daadaŋ alokile ke epei, kisiboik ikes nakwap daadaŋ, kedau atubun apaki ŋina eyaryata ka neni iboikinosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etiyae Akuj ŋun, ikotere kiwara ŋituŋa iŋes, toraraput, ido toryamut iŋes. Tari kikote nen daŋ, nyelwana iŋes aneni yok a daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
